# DashForge 3D level format v1
level_name Tutorial
start 0 1 0
end 44 1 0

# object <type> <x> <y> <z> <sx> <sy> <sz> <rotY>
# Floor
object block 0 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 1 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 2 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 3 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 4 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 5 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 6 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 7 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 8 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 9 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 10 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 11 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 12 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 13 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 14 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 15 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 16 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 17 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 18 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 19 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 20 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 21 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 22 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 23 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 24 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 25 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 26 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 27 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 28 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 29 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 30 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 31 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 32 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 33 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 34 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 35 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 36 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 37 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 38 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 39 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 40 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 41 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 42 0 0 1 1 1 0
object block 43 0 0 1 1 1 0

# Obstacle 1: single spike (easy intro)
object spike 8 1 0 1 1 1 0

# Obstacle 2: two spikes side by side (a bit harder)
object spike 16 1 0 1 1 1 0
object spike 17 1 0 1 1 1 0

# Obstacle 3: single spike after gap
object spike 25 1 0 1 1 1 0

# Obstacle 4: low wall to jump over
object block 32 1 0 1 1 1 0

# Obstacle 5: final two spikes
object spike 37 1 0 1 1 1 0
object spike 38 1 0 1 1 1 0

# End marker
object end 42 1 0 1 2 1 0
